TITLE

 biodegradation of toluene - uniform flow

UNITS

        -time                   year

        -horizontal_grid        meters

        -vertical_grid          meters

        -head                   meters

        -hydraulic_conductivity m/day

        -specific_storage       1/m

        -dispersivity           m

SOLUTION_METHOD

        -direct_solver       true

        -space_differencing     0

        -time_differencing      1.

SOLUTE_TRANSPORT	true

	diffusivity		0.0		

STEADY_FLOW     true

	-head_tolerance   		1e-8

	-flow_balance_tolerance 	0.001

	-minimum_time_step   		1 

	-maximum_time_step   		10.0 

	-head_change_limit   		100.0

GRID

        -uniform x  0.00000      1.0   101

        -uniform y  0.00000      1.0     2

        -uniform z  0.00000      1.0     2

        -print_orientation XY

FLUID_PROPERTIES

        -compressibility        0.0             #1/Pa

        -density                1000.           #kg/m^3

        -viscosity              0.001           #Pa-s

        -diffusivity            0.0             #m^2/s        

MEDIA

        -zone   0 0 0 1  1 1

                -porosity                    0.4

                -long_dispersivity           0.01

                -horizontal_dispersivity     0.000001

                -vertical_dispersivity       0.000001

                -Kx                     1

                -Ky                     1

                -Kz                     1       # m/d

                -storage                0

SPECIFIED_HEAD_BC

        -zone   0 0 0 0 1 1

                -head                   0   3.456e-5

                -associated_solution    0          1

        -zone   1 0 0 1 1 1

                -head          0     0.0

                -associated_solution  0    2

FREE_SURFACE_BC         false

HEAD_IC

        -zone   0. 0. 0. 1. 1. 1.

                -head   0.

CHEMISTRY_IC

        -zone   0. 0. 0. 1. 1. 1.

                -solution               2

        -equilibrium_phases	1

TIME_CONTROL

        -delta_time    0       0.1     year

        -end_time              100     year

PRINT_INITIAL

        -velocities             true

        -xyz_head               true

        -xyz_chemistry          false 

        -HDF_heads              true

PRINT_FREQUENCY

        0 

        -hdf_chemistry          10        year

        -xyz_chemistry          10        year

        -bc_flow_rates          10        year

        -xyz_components         10        year

        -xyz_head               10        year

        -xyz_velocity           10        year

        -save_final_heads       true

END

